## 12. Termination

If You violate this license, Your permissions under this license terminate automatically.

Your permissions are reinstated if You cure the violation within 30 days after becoming aware of it, unless the same or substantially similar violation has previously occurred.

Termination does not affect the rights of other recipients who remain in compliance with this license.

